  "scope": "Original FV paid movement/fire/collapse with both actual physical Anytown CABHUT Structures rows and full Building AI, followed by admitted bridge repair.",
  "boundaries": [
    "Extends the existing paid_world.Paid owner. Its physical whole-map Cell/TMP/Terrain/graph, supplied human FV House, Unit/Drive/command/Logic/Bullet/Anim and declared OS/asset boundaries remain unchanged. This packet is a separate composition and does not replace the no-Building paid golden.",
