    "Original Basic NewINIFormat4 read/store and full Building map reader44F820 consume the two exact physical Structures rows for huts85,58 and89,51, including full43B740 construction,440580 placement and authored flags. Other physical Buildings, Units, Infantry, ambient Anim and Terrain live-AI are excluded. Initial physical Terrain placement remains the existing paid boundary.",
    "Huts are constructed after the FV command at frame1, so actual native IDs, constructor RNG and append order reflect this declared boundary rather than ScenarioLoad chronology. Neutral is the only constructed House registry entry; the inherited source House remains supplied. Full House/global Scenario phases are excluded.",
    "Both full BuildingAI43FB20 objects execute in original live Logic order through both Bullet impacts and effect drain. Original NotifyBridgeSpanCollapse575EE0 and global Techno target detach70D4A0 execute with actual huts. Original573540 is then invoked at the established admitted repair start; this is not a new Engineer admission/lifecycle witness.",
    "OS InterlockedIncrement/Decrement at4A0535/4A0557 transport preserves the atomic count and return value for this single-threaded original COM lifetime; native gameplay instructions and returns are not patched. Three full RNG streams, all source/Drive/hut bytes, memberships, object IDs, callbacks and original.text identity are retained.",
    "Every replay freshly executes all four physical states via the existing original Navigation owner and compares all frozen cells/planes/graphs before selecting damaged. No external heap cache or pickle input is supported."
